has too much power. What it is enforces are more like laws.

>	That mission is not free speech but free inquiry. And 
>free inquiry -- the pursuit of truth -- is simply not possible 
>when there are no etiquette restrictions on speech, just as the 
>pursuit of justice would not be possible in a courtroom in which 
>mayhem and invectives were permitted. 
