: >[...]
: >>If someone else is paying for your right to post, shouldn't that person have
: >>a say in what you post?  Or if nothing else, not tolerate posts that he/she
: >>finds offensive, etc.? 
: >[...]
: >
: >Is that really what you want? No free speech except on street corners
