    receives.

Meanwhile ...

2b. Sylvia criticizes in soc.motss the posting of email to soc.motss.
    In her article she used the word "fuck"(??). [Can anyone send
    me a copy of this article? -carl]

3b. Mr. Mealey, reading Sylvia's article sends out many complaints to
    Hahnemann (Sylvia's school, a private secular college in
    Philadelphia) and Columbia U. the site from which Sylvia posts.

4b. Sylvia posts to soc.motss quotes and paraphrases of email from Mr.
    Mealey. [Can anyone send me a copy of this article? -carl]

5b. Ms. Shore posts a follow up saying that Mr. Mealey's writing is
    "really funny." (article appended).

6b. Mr. Mealey reads Ms. Shore article and Ms. Shore's private email
